<%- include('partials/header', { fullWidth: true }) %>

<div class="page-banner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/tournaments">Tournaments</a> / <a href="/tournaments/<%= g.slug %>">ECC 2026</a> / Gazebos</p>
    <h1>ECC 2026 competition area</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap narrow-page">
  <p class="lead">Every team has a boat storage space and a gazebo or tent. Find your team below, then look for the same number on the map.</p>

  <label class="f-search gz-search"><span>Find your team</span><input type="search" data-filter-list="gz-list" placeholder="Type a team name" autocomplete="off"></label>

  <ol class="gz-list" id="gz-list">
    <% g.teams.forEach((name, i) => { %>
    <li data-text="<%= name.toLowerCase() %>"><span class="gz-n"><%= i + 1 %></span><span class="gz-name"><%= name || 'Not assigned' %></span></li>
    <% }) %>
  </ol>
  <p class="gz-none" hidden>No team matches. Check the spelling or look at the full list.</p>

  <h2 class="sub-head">Site map</h2>
  <p>Tap the map to open it full size and zoom in. The handwritten numbers 1 to 30 match the list above: they sit in the green boat storage areas and beside the red tents (the circled numbers 1 to 6 are the tents themselves, not team numbers). HQ is the competition headquarters and the four pitches are along the water.</p>
  <a href="<%= g.image %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img class="gz-map" src="<%= g.image %>" alt="Site map of the ECC 2026 competition area showing gazebo and boat storage numbers 1 to 30, the HQ building and pitches 1 to 4" width="1800" height="1000"></a>
  <p class="muted">Placement list and map come directly from the organiser. There may be a discrepancy, which the organiser will check and clear up soon. Check the official bulletin for updates.</p>
  <p><a class="btn" href="/tournaments/<%= g.slug %>">Back to information and schedule</a></p>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
